        "Content": "<ul><li>Privately set just off the main street in Ballyvaughan</li><li>Walking distance to all local amenities</li><li>Ballyvaughan is at the heart of the Burren</li><li>Built in mid 1800's</li><li>Private courtyard</li><li>May qualify for 70,000 derelict house grant and energy grants</ul>"
